      "title": "Cilium L2 LoadBalancing",
      "items": [
        "Traefik reverse proxy is deliberately bypassed for all game traffic",
        "Cilium advertises L2 IPs (192.168.20.224 for Valheim, 192.168.20.225 for Minecraft)",
        "Zero-proxy direct client connectivity eliminates NAT jitter and protocol translation"
      ]
