        "Control plane runs Agrelha Go server with Datastar SSE streaming live metrics",
        "Whitelist and ops commands execute live via RCON (TCP 25575) and commit to GitOps ConfigMaps",
        "Backup tarballs stream directly to TrueNAS storage over NFS"
      ]
    },
